        "required_age": 0,
        "is_free": false,
        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3274090/extras/26069ea16cc9a3de25908dae0aa3e403.poster.avif?t=1767955250\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3274090/extras/26069ea16cc9a3de25908dae0aa3e403.webm?t=1767955250\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3274090/extras/26069ea16cc9a3de25908dae0aa3e403.mp4?t=1767955250\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>NEW! Ascension Mode</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast, Intense, and Competitive. Discover pure combat runs! You start with a generous inventory featuring guaranteed rare tiles. Shortened animations, tight timings, intense music. No dilemmas, no detours - dive into rhythmic battles with enticing rewards. Climb the global leaderboard, challenge your friends, face escalating difficulty and aim for the perfect score.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You are not the hero. You are the monster.</strong> Unbound Eternity is a deck-builder with turn-based combat where you invade the lands of the &quot;Eye&quot; cult. Master your characters and their rune combos, craft your deck, and forge your path.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story Mode: Unlock &amp; Conquer</strong> Discover characters, powers, and secrets. Navigate between battles, merchants, and twisted dilemmas. Collect permanent buffs and artifacts to challenge the cult's hero.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Runes Are Your Engine</strong> Spend runes to play cards. Chain tiles, poison enemies, sacrifice health for devastating attacks. Each monster has multiple runes per turn - use them for brutal combos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Created by an Indie Duo</strong> Solid mechanics, replayability, and dark humor. 2 to 8+ hours per Story run - or endless hours in Ascension. All the cards are in your hand. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So, are you ready?</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3274090/extras/26069ea16cc9a3de25908dae0aa3e403.poster.avif?t=1767955250\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3274090/extras/26069ea16cc9a3de25908dae0aa3e403.webm?t=1767955250\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3274090/extras/26069ea16cc9a3de25908dae0aa3e403.mp4?t=1767955250\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>NEW! Ascension Mode</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast, Intense, and Competitive. Discover pure combat runs! You start with a generous inventory featuring guaranteed rare tiles. Shortened animations, tight timings, intense music. No dilemmas, no detours - dive into rhythmic battles with enticing rewards. Climb the global leaderboard, challenge your friends, face escalating difficulty and aim for the perfect score.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You are not the hero. You are the monster.</strong> Unbound Eternity is a deck-builder with turn-based combat where you invade the lands of the &quot;Eye&quot; cult. Master your characters and their rune combos, craft your deck, and forge your path.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story Mode: Unlock &amp; Conquer</strong> Discover characters, powers, and secrets. Navigate between battles, merchants, and twisted dilemmas. Collect permanent buffs and artifacts to challenge the cult's hero.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Runes Are Your Engine</strong> Spend runes to play cards. Chain tiles, poison enemies, sacrifice health for devastating attacks. Each monster has multiple runes per turn - use them for brutal combos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Created by an Indie Duo</strong> Solid mechanics, replayability, and dark humor. 2 to 8+ hours per Story run - or endless hours in Ascension. All the cards are in your hand. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So, are you ready?</p>",
        "short_description": "Unbound Eternity is a turn-based combat game with deck-building mechanics where you play as a monster. Invade a mysterious domain, create powerful cards, and seize every opportunity to establish your reign over the world!",
        "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French<strong>*</strong>, Simplified Chinese<strong>*</strong>, Japanese<strong>*</strong>, Korean<strong>*</strong>, Spanish - Spain<strong>*</strong>, Spanish - Latin America<strong>*</strong>, Russian<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support",
